      "@type": "AnalogicalMapping",
      "instance_name": "mapping_1",
      "label": "child is the speaker of the text",
      "description": "The text 'my dad is the best at hide and seek' is attributed to the child in the image, who is visually depicted as the speaker. The child's solemn expression and the context of the text imply that the child is the one who is speaking these words, even though the text is presented as a statement about the child's experience. The visual material (the child) is mapped onto the textual material (the statement) as the entity being referred to by the text.",
